From: =?utf-8?b?T25kxZllaiBTdXLDvQ==?= <ondrej@sury.org>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:51:07 +0100
Subject: Backport the intl test updates for ICU 58 to 63

PHP 5.6 never got the test updates for ICU 58 and newer: the tests whose
results changed are limited to the older ICU versions and get a variant
for the newer ones, and three expectations are relaxed. Backport of
upstream commits 877e0b04bc4, 7240d998381 and 9071ff5c872 (PHP 7.0.26),
398f56dbc85 (PHP 7.1.17), 5af0db88faf (PHP 7.1.20) and 4461fb9c264
(PHP 7.1.24); of the new variants only the ones for the current ICU are
taken. spoofchecker_001 has no variant for ICU 58 and newer that works
with PHP 5.6.
